{"page":562,"width":1501,"height":1997,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"인역스 류님","words":[{"text":"인역스","x":1237,"y":78,"width":55,"height":24},{"text":"류님","x":1301,"y":78,"width":37,"height":25}]},{"text":"첫 번째는 SQL Server의 클러스터형 인덱스와 Oracle I(Jr로서, 테이블을 인덱스 구조로 생성하는 것이라고","words":[{"text":"첫","x":205,"y":202,"width":20,"height":27},{"text":"번째는","x":238,"y":202,"width":71,"height":27},{"text":"SQL","x":319,"y":204,"width":47,"height":28},{"text":"Server의","x":375,"y":201,"width":94,"height":27},{"text":"클러스터형","x":481,"y":201,"width":109,"height":29},{"text":"인덱스와","x":603,"y":202,"width":90,"height":28},{"text":"Oracle","x":701,"y":203,"width":74,"height":24},{"text":"I(Jr로서,","x":786,"y":201,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"테이블을","x":895,"y":202,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"인덱스","x":995,"y":202,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"구조로","x":1072,"y":204,"width":69,"height":25},{"text":"생성하는","x":1151,"y":202,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"것이라고","x":1250,"y":202,"width":91,"height":28}]},{"text":"앞서 설명했다. 테이블 자체가 인덱스 구조이므로 항상 정렬된 상태를 유지한다. 더불어 인덱스 리프 볼록이 곧","words":[{"text":"앞서","x":172,"y":246,"width":46,"height":26},{"text":"설명했다.","x":233,"y":244,"width":99,"height":28},{"text":"테이블","x":346,"y":244,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"자체가","x":425,"y":245,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"인덱스","x":504,"y":245,"width":67,"height":27},{"text":"구조이므로","x":580,"y":246,"width":112,"height":27},{"text":"항상","x":702,"y":245,"width":46,"height":28},{"text":"정렬된","x":759,"y":245,"width":67,"height":27},{"text":"상태를","x":839,"y":246,"width":68,"height":28},{"text":"유지한다.","x":918,"y":246,"width":96,"height":27},{"text":"더불어","x":1028,"y":246,"width":66,"height":27},{"text":"인덱스","x":1107,"y":246,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"리프","x":1186,"y":246,"width":43,"height":26},{"text":"볼록이","x":1239,"y":246,"width":65,"height":28},{"text":"곧","x":1317,"y":248,"width":23,"height":25}]},{"text":"데이터 블록이어서 인덱스를 수직 탐색한 다음에 테이블 레코드를 읽기 위한 추가적인 랜덤 액세스가 불필요하다.","words":[{"text":"데이터","x":172,"y":289,"width":69,"height":27},{"text":"블록이어서","x":253,"y":288,"width":114,"height":28},{"text":"인덱스를","x":379,"y":288,"width":91,"height":28},{"text":"수직","x":478,"y":289,"width":42,"height":27},{"text":"탐색한","x":533,"y":289,"width":66,"height":27},{"text":"다음에","x":608,"y":289,"width":65,"height":28},{"text":"테이블","x":684,"y":288,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"레코드를","x":760,"y":288,"width":90,"height":29},{"text":"읽기","x":861,"y":289,"width":43,"height":28},{"text":"위한","x":915,"y":290,"width":47,"height":27},{"text":"추가적인","x":970,"y":290,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"랜덤","x":1071,"y":290,"width":42,"height":28},{"text":"액세스가","x":1124,"y":290,"width":90,"height":28},{"text":"불필요하다.","x":1222,"y":290,"width":117,"height":28}]},{"text":"두 번째는 SQL *의 lnclude lndex이다. 인덱스 기 외에 미리 지정한 칼럼을 리프 레벨에 함께 저장하는","words":[{"text":"두","x":201,"y":335,"width":25,"height":25},{"text":"번째는","x":236,"y":333,"width":71,"height":27},{"text":"SQL","x":316,"y":334,"width":47,"height":29},{"text":"*의","x":372,"y":332,"width":92,"height":27},{"text":"lnclude","x":476,"y":334,"width":84,"height":24},{"text":"lndex이다.","x":570,"y":333,"width":112,"height":27},{"text":"인덱스","x":694,"y":332,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"기","x":771,"y":332,"width":19,"height":28},{"text":"외에","x":802,"y":333,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"미리","x":858,"y":333,"width":43,"height":27},{"text":"지정한","x":913,"y":333,"width":68,"height":28},{"text":"칼럼을","x":990,"y":334,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"리프","x":1069,"y":334,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"레벨에","x":1122,"y":334,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"함께","x":1198,"y":333,"width":43,"height":28},{"text":"저장하는","x":1252,"y":333,"width":89,"height":28}]},{"text":"기능으로서, 데이를 랜덤 액세스 횟수를 줄이도록 돕는다. 잠시 후 종 더 자세하게 설명하겠다.","words":[{"text":"기능으로서,","x":172,"y":377,"width":124,"height":30},{"text":"데이를","x":312,"y":376,"width":69,"height":27},{"text":"랜덤","x":393,"y":376,"width":43,"height":28},{"text":"액세스","x":451,"y":376,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"횟수를","x":531,"y":377,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"줄이도록","x":608,"y":378,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"돕는다.","x":709,"y":376,"width":74,"height":28},{"text":"잠시","x":797,"y":377,"width":43,"height":28},{"text":"후","x":854,"y":377,"width":24,"height":28},{"text":"종","x":889,"y":379,"width":23,"height":26},{"text":"더","x":926,"y":378,"width":19,"height":28},{"text":"자세하게","x":960,"y":378,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"설명하겠다.","x":1063,"y":379,"width":119,"height":28}]},{"text":"세 번째는 Oracle이 제공하는 클러스터 테이*(Clustered Table)이다. 기 값이 같은 레코드를 같은 볼록에","words":[{"text":"세","x":201,"y":421,"width":22,"height":27},{"text":"번째는","x":238,"y":421,"width":71,"height":27},{"text":"Oracle이","x":320,"y":420,"width":96,"height":27},{"text":"제공하는","x":432,"y":421,"width":89,"height":27},{"text":"클러스터","x":532,"y":421,"width":88,"height":28},{"text":"테이*(Clustered","x":634,"y":421,"width":182,"height":30},{"text":"Table)이다.","x":827,"y":422,"width":124,"height":30},{"text":"기","x":965,"y":422,"width":21,"height":28},{"text":"값이","x":1000,"y":422,"width":43,"height":28},{"text":"같은","x":1057,"y":423,"width":46,"height":27},{"text":"레코드를","x":1115,"y":424,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"같은","x":1216,"y":422,"width":45,"height":28},{"text":"볼록에","x":1272,"y":422,"width":66,"height":28}]},{"text":"저장하기 때문에 클러스터 테이블에 대한 클러스터 인덱스를 이용할 때는 테이블 랜덤 액세스가 기 값별로 한","words":[{"text":"저장하기","x":170,"y":465,"width":94,"height":28},{"text":"때문에","x":280,"y":464,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"클러스터","x":360,"y":464,"width":90,"height":28},{"text":"테이블에","x":465,"y":464,"width":88,"height":28},{"text":"대한","x":567,"y":465,"width":44,"height":28},{"text":"클러스터","x":622,"y":465,"width":88,"height":29},{"text":"인덱스를","x":724,"y":465,"width":91,"height":29},{"text":"이용할","x":826,"y":466,"width":69,"height":28},{"text":"때는","x":907,"y":466,"width":45,"height":28},{"text":"테이블","x":964,"y":466,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"랜덤","x":1045,"y":467,"width":43,"height":27},{"text":"액세스가","x":1102,"y":467,"width":92,"height":28},{"text":"기","x":1205,"y":467,"width":19,"height":28},{"text":"값별로","x":1238,"y":467,"width":69,"height":27},{"text":"한","x":1317,"y":466,"width":25,"height":28}]},{"text":"번씩만 발생한다. 클러스터에 도달해서는 시원설 방식으로 스캔하기 때문에 넓은 범위를 읽더라도 비효율이 없다.","words":[{"text":"번씩만","x":170,"y":509,"width":72,"height":27},{"text":"발생한다.","x":252,"y":509,"width":98,"height":27},{"text":"클러스터에","x":363,"y":509,"width":112,"height":27},{"text":"도달해서는","x":485,"y":509,"width":113,"height":29},{"text":"시원설","x":607,"y":510,"width":65,"height":27},{"text":"방식으로","x":682,"y":510,"width":90,"height":28},{"text":"스캔하기","x":781,"y":510,"width":88,"height":28},{"text":"때문에","x":881,"y":510,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"넓은","x":959,"y":511,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"범위를","x":1012,"y":510,"width":69,"height":28},{"text":"읽더라도","x":1091,"y":511,"width":91,"height":27},{"text":"비효율이","x":1191,"y":511,"width":88,"height":27},{"text":"없다.","x":1290,"y":510,"width":51,"height":28}]},{"text":"네 번째는 파티셔님이다. 읽고자 하는 데이터가 많을 때는 인덱스를 이용하지 않는 편이 낫다고 하지만, 수천만","words":[{"text":"네","x":200,"y":553,"width":22,"height":27},{"text":"번째는","x":234,"y":553,"width":70,"height":27},{"text":"파티셔님이다.","x":313,"y":553,"width":144,"height":28},{"text":"읽고자","x":469,"y":553,"width":66,"height":28},{"text":"하는","x":544,"y":554,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"데이터가","x":599,"y":554,"width":88,"height":28},{"text":"많을","x":696,"y":554,"width":44,"height":28},{"text":"때는","x":750,"y":554,"width":44,"height":28},{"text":"인덱스를","x":804,"y":554,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"이용하지","x":903,"y":554,"width":86,"height":28},{"text":"않는","x":1001,"y":554,"width":46,"height":27},{"text":"편이","x":1056,"y":554,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"낫다고","x":1113,"y":554,"width":67,"height":28},{"text":"하지만,","x":1189,"y":554,"width":73,"height":30},{"text":"수천만","x":1273,"y":554,"width":69,"height":28}]},{"text":"건에 이르는 테이블을 Full Scan해야 한다면 난감하기 그지없다. 그럴 때 대량 범위검색 조건으로 자주 사용되는","words":[{"text":"건에","x":168,"y":598,"width":46,"height":26},{"text":"이르는","x":227,"y":598,"width":71,"height":26},{"text":"테이블을","x":309,"y":597,"width":92,"height":28},{"text":"Full","x":411,"y":599,"width":44,"height":24},{"text":"Scan해야","x":464,"y":598,"width":99,"height":28},{"text":"한다면","x":571,"y":598,"width":66,"height":27},{"text":"난감하기","x":648,"y":598,"width":86,"height":28},{"text":"그지없다.","x":745,"y":598,"width":97,"height":28},{"text":"그럴","x":852,"y":598,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"때","x":908,"y":598,"width":20,"height":27},{"text":"대량","x":940,"y":598,"width":45,"height":28},{"text":"범위검색","x":995,"y":597,"width":89,"height":28},{"text":"조건으로","x":1093,"y":598,"width":93,"height":27},{"text":"자주","x":1195,"y":598,"width":47,"height":27},{"text":"사용되는","x":1250,"y":598,"width":93,"height":28}]},{"text":"칼럼 기준으로 테이블을 파티셔님한다면 Full Table Scan을 하더라도 일부 파티션만 읽고 멈추게 할 수 있다","words":[{"text":"칼럼","x":167,"y":642,"width":46,"height":27},{"text":"기준으로","x":228,"y":642,"width":96,"height":28},{"text":"테이블을","x":336,"y":642,"width":92,"height":28},{"text":"파티셔님한다면","x":438,"y":642,"width":156,"height":28},{"text":"Full","x":606,"y":644,"width":44,"height":24},{"text":"Table","x":660,"y":644,"width":63,"height":24},{"text":"Scan을","x":734,"y":643,"width":77,"height":27},{"text":"하더라도","x":821,"y":642,"width":92,"height":29},{"text":"일부","x":924,"y":642,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"파티션만","x":978,"y":641,"width":94,"height":28},{"text":"읽고","x":1082,"y":642,"width":47,"height":27},{"text":"멈추게","x":1141,"y":642,"width":67,"height":27},{"text":"할","x":1220,"y":642,"width":25,"height":27},{"text":"수","x":1254,"y":643,"width":24,"height":26},{"text":"있다","x":1289,"y":642,"width":52,"height":28}]},{"text":"클러스터는 기준 기 값이 같은 레코드를 블록 단위로 모아 저장하지만, 파티셔님은 세그먼트 단위로 저장하는","words":[{"text":"클러스터는","x":197,"y":686,"width":121,"height":28},{"text":"기준","x":330,"y":686,"width":45,"height":28},{"text":"기","x":386,"y":687,"width":20,"height":27},{"text":"값이","x":418,"y":687,"width":43,"height":27},